{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜內地進出口數據(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-11-12-37-19ZKBrBpaE.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：內地進出口數據</p><p>內地上月出口升逾三成半，進口升逾四成，是近五年半以來最大升幅，背後有甚麼原因帶動？未來走勢是怎樣？物流業界又能否受惠？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>供應鏈及經濟學者袁尚文</p><p>法國外貿銀行亞太區高級經濟學家吳卓殷</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:14:10.315167+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:38.580569+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:07:48.397724+00:00","content_hash":"9a3b80b23998e0b3166b0630b2c3a49c745d49fad31e9202b659a2ae5b8460ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}